<article class="env-proposition" id="09TN">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/09TN">Proposition <span data-tag="09TN">75.12.6</span>.</a> Let $S$ be a scheme. Let $X$ be a Noetherian algebraic space over $S$. Then the functor (<a href="/tag/08F1" data-tag="08F1">75.5.1.1</a>) </p>
  <div class="equation">
  \[  D(\mathit{QCoh}(\mathcal{O}_ X)) \longrightarrow D_\mathit{QCoh}(\mathcal{O}_ X)  \]
</div>
  <p> is an equivalence with quasi-inverse given by $RQ_ X$. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      Follows immediately from Lemmas <a href="/tag/09TM" data-tag="09TM">75.12.5</a> and <a href="/tag/09TG" data-tag="09TG">75.11.4</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>